  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MoU with ICIMOD for Nature Based and Air Pollution Solutions in the  Hindu Kush Himalaya - RDEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICIMOD aims to support CARA by significantly contributing to its overall objective through implementing HI-REAP programme in the specified landscapes in the HKH region. The 3 focus areas are :
* Regional Cooperation and Collaboration for Policy Influence and Investment
* Nature-based Solutions
* Air Pollution Solutions</narrative>
  </description>
